    "body": "I personally think explainers are fine in WHATWG repos, e.g. we have them in whatwg/streams. They can be a crutch, however, leading to people avoiding putting the useful text into the spec itself; so please do avoid that failure mode.\r\n\r\nIMO it should be up to the repo editors to decide on things like that.",
