    "updated_at": "2022-08-31T23:43:59Z",
    "body": "> Expose our internal IDs\r\n\r\nIf at all possible, I would recommend that the standard require IDs to be returned as v4 (random) UUIDs, which act as a facade over any internal IDs. This guarantees a cross-browser-compatible format which developers can't take any dependency on.",
